                        "form_id": "7d1cf6be-88f4-4335-bc7c-82ad8fd62769",
                        "entry_id": "4fea7e8b-7e23-3d91-8033-3892449d134d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "anarcho-capitalistes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2bba8037-b309-3c45-a0c5-043728d7cf24",
                        "entry_id": "4fea7e8b-7e23-3d91-8033-3892449d134d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à l’anarcho-capitalisme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d00842a-10e1-49a5-aea8-b458f90e72fd",
                                "sense_id": "2bba8037-b309-3c45-a0c5-043728d7cf24",
                                "text": "Dans la société anarcho-capitaliste, chaque individu est souverain, sa propriété est inviolable, et c’est à chacun de protéger sa personne et son territoire souverain."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2cee98c8-3119-41d8-89fa-382e731c02c5",
                                "sense_id": "2bba8037-b309-3c45-a0c5-043728d7cf24",
                                "text": "Dans le domaine économique, Milei se reconnaît comme anarcho-capitaliste et défend un programme inspiré de l'école autrichienne, qui vise à drastiquement diminuer le poids de l'État : il souhaite ainsi supprimer la banque centrale argentine, remplacer le peso argentin par le dollar américain, supprimer les aides sociales, limiter le nombre de ministres aux fonctions régaliennes et diviser par deux les dépenses publiques."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "df3ce56b-9b0d-44e6-976d-9ab704c6779d",
                        "source_entry_id": "4fea7e8b-7e23-3d91-8033-3892449d134d",
                        "source_sense_id": "2bba8037-b309-3c45-a0c5-043728d7cf24",
                        "target_lang_word": "anarcho-capitalist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anarcho-capitalist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "950219e6-ccf9-3bab-b5a2-1f12dc3f6b90",
                                        "entry_id": "dafe839c-28c3-3be3-a68b-7ba7055bc86b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, pertaining to, or advocating anarcho-capitalism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "065635a2-61cc-4faa-88ca-bd7b49d5d950",
                                                "sense_id": "950219e6-ccf9-3bab-b5a2-1f12dc3f6b90",
                                                "text": "[…] Lysander Spooner’s brilliantly hard-hitting No Treason, one of the masterpieces of anti-statism and reprinted by an anarcho-capitalist press, has had considerable influence in converting present-day youth to libertarianism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d32d195-c1be-4b9d-8911-85ef421afaef",
                                                "sense_id": "950219e6-ccf9-3bab-b5a2-1f12dc3f6b90",
                                                "text": "Even beyond the anarcho-capitalist cryptocurrency Bitcoin, many entrepreneurs make overtly political calls for private, extranational money, for direct and disintermediated economic communication, for either total privacy or total publicity in transactions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "anarcho-capitalist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31960b03-190f-3a79-abb6-71c2f13edc6a",
                                        "entry_id": "bf5a8a9d-5616-3c8d-a90d-388e3da4c5b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A proponent of anarcho-capitalism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8480861d-4561-4378-8976-bf7d5cfdee35",
                                                "sense_id": "31960b03-190f-3a79-abb6-71c2f13edc6a",
                                                "text": "It is safe to say that the great bulk of right-libertarians are anarcho-capitalists, particularly among the youth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ef5993c-45cf-4972-9d1b-abd2e0f222c0",
                                                "sense_id": "31960b03-190f-3a79-abb6-71c2f13edc6a",
                                                "text": "But Liberland is Mecca for libertarians' more radical strands, especially ‘anarcho-capitalists’, people who believe the state should be abolished entirely, replaced by individuals clubbing together to contract services from private companies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5fec7eac-6e42-428c-9e62-74d529b59632",
                                                "sense_id": "31960b03-190f-3a79-abb6-71c2f13edc6a",
                                                "text": "The Silicon Valley billionaire Peter Thiel, a self-described anarcho-capitalist, is a major supporter of the movement – which, like space colonization, seems to attract the enthusiasm of a certain kind of fantastically rich and rightwing tech baron."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d62a844-36ab-452c-be98-d1e51ed0b49b",
                                                "sense_id": "31960b03-190f-3a79-abb6-71c2f13edc6a",
                                                "text": "At his final campaign event in Buenos Aires on Wednesday, the 53-year-old “anarcho-capitalist” addressed a packed 15,000-capacity stadium from a stage adorned with a banner proclaiming him “The Only Solution” to Argentina’s economic malaise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "992ecf50-8e8e-3f49-a930-61c87f6e5bed",
                "word": "anarcho-capitaliste",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ff2b9d56-c2e4-4858-a4fe-cd02f716a21d",
                        "entry_id": "992ecf50-8e8e-3f49-a930-61c87f6e5bed",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "anarcho-capitalistes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6d347f78-6d40-3bbe-9dca-1c70c49ec927",
                        "entry_id": "992ecf50-8e8e-3f49-a930-61c87f6e5bed",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne partisane de l’anarcho-capitalisme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "36d89a35-9d0b-408c-9001-ce67ac1ed27f",
                                "sense_id": "6d347f78-6d40-3bbe-9dca-1c70c49ec927",
                                "text": "Un historien de ce mouvement d’idées, Pierre Lemieux, affirme bien dans son étude que Molinari est le « premier anarcho-capitaliste » …."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "272fc566-c644-4946-bfcf-34b4069b537f",
                                "sense_id": "6d347f78-6d40-3bbe-9dca-1c70c49ec927",
                                "text": "Les anarcho-capitalistes soutiennent que leur position est authentiquement anarchiste puisqu’elle est anti-étatiste ; ils ajoutent enfin que ce qui les distingue des anarchistes classiques (ou « de gauche ») est surtout qu’ils pensent que l’égalitarisme est un leurre : ne concevant pas d’autre égalité possible que l’égalité de droit, les anarcho-capitalistes assurent donc que les inégalités de fait entre individus s’exprimeront immanquablement dans une société libre."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
